<section id="support" class="support">
  <div class="page-container support-inner">
    <header class="support-header">
      <span class="support-eyebrow"><span lang="en">// SUPPORT</span><span lang="es">// APOYAR</span></span>
      <h2 class="support-heading">
        <span lang="en">One developer.<br />Open source.</span><span lang="es">Un dev.<br />Código abierto.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="support-lead">
        <span lang="en">SEELE is built and maintained by <a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Orlando Nahuel Vazquez Gonzalez</a> under DevZen SpA. If it saves you time, here are the ways to give some back.</span><span lang="es">SEELE lo construye y mantiene <a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Orlando Nahuel Vazquez Gonzalez</a> bajo DevZen SpA. Si te ahorra tiempo, acá van formas de devolver algo.</span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <ol class="ways">
      <li>
        <span class="way-num">// 01</span>
        <div class="way-body">
          <h3 class="way-title"><span lang="en">Star <span class="amp">·</span> share</span><span lang="es">Estrella <span class="amp">·</span> compartir</span></h3>
          <p>
            <span lang="en">The <a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele" rel="noopener" target="_blank">repo</a>. Visibility brings contributors. Contributors make the tool better for everyone.</span><span lang="es">El <a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele" rel="noopener" target="_blank">repo</a>. Visibilidad trae contribuidores. Contribuidores mejoran la herramienta para todos.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="way-num">// 02</span>
        <div class="way-body">
          <h3 class="way-title"><span lang="en">Open issues</span><span lang="es">Abrir issues</span></h3>
          <p><span lang="en">Feedback. Bug reports. Friction. Tell me what hurts when you use it.</span><span lang="es">Feedback. Bug reports. Fricciones. Decime qué duele cuando lo usás.</span></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="way-num">// 03</span>
        <div class="way-body">
          <h3 class="way-title"><span lang="en">Hire <span class="amp">·</span> consult</span><span lang="es">Contratar <span class="amp">·</span> consultoría</span></h3>
          <p>
            <span lang="en">Via a <a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele/discussions" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Discussion</a> if your team uses SEELE in production.</span><span lang="es">Vía un <a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele/discussions" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Discussion</a> si tu equipo usa SEELE en producción.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .support {
    padding-block: var(--space-20);
    border-bottom: var(--border-base) solid var(--semantic-border-base);
  }

  .support-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .support-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-caps);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .support-heading {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: var(--weight-black);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .support-lead {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .support-lead a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  }

  .support-lead a:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }

  .ways {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-16);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-left: var(--space-14);
  }

  .ways li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding-block: var(--space-3);
    border-top: var(--border-hair) solid var(--semantic-border-muted);
  }

  .way-num {
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-caps);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-top: var(--space-1);
  }

  .way-title {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-1);
  }

  .way-body p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .way-body a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .way-body a:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }

  .amp {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .ways {
      margin-left: 0;
    }

    .ways li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-2);
    }
  }
</style>
